    "Details": "A one of a kind Rattlesnake developed by Headhunter Stables of Solaris 7; the Rattlesnake JR7-31R was piloted by Gideon Wozniak during his arena fight with the wanted war criminal and ex ROM agent, Victor Reskov. Built from a Rattlesnake JR7-37, the 37R model upgrades the Mech with Clan made Ferro-Fibrous armor and MASC. 2 Clan ER Medium Lasers, 3 Medium Lasers and a Clan ER Small Laser form the Mechs armament; with Angel ECM and a Clan made Targeting Computer enhancing the Mechs effectiveness.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.02</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
